 '                        "text": "2.12 Customers bringing dogs should arrange '
 'for their dogs to stay at suitable locations to prevent them from entering '
 'the food room and areas where food is handled, cooked or stored, and to '
 'ensure that they will not cause obstruction to any passageway, fire escape '
 'or emergency exit. As per the requirements by individual restaurants, dogs '
 'should be arranged to stay on pet mats or pee pads. If the restaurant does '
 'not allow dogs on customers\' seats, the dogs should stay on the floor.",\n'
