 'by dog excrement, the relevant customer should take the responsibility to '
 'promptly clean up and properly dispose of the excrement (e.g. by wrapping '
 'the excrement in a sealed bag for proper disposal in dog-specific trash '
 'bins), and notify the restaurant staff to inspect the area or carry out '
 'further disinfection, so as to maintain good environmental hygiene. After '
 'the clean-up, the customer should thoroughly wash and disinfect his '
 'hands.",\n'
