 '                "orig": "2.6 To safeguard the health of other pets and '
 'customers, customers bringing dogs are advised to deworm their dogs, protect '
 'them from fleas and keep them in good hygiene condition (e.g. having clean '
 'fur). They should not bring their dogs to restaurants if their dogs are '
 'physically unwell, or suspected of suffering from an infectious disease.",\n'
