 '                        "text": "1.6 Restaurant operators may, as needed, '
 'designate by themselves specific sessions and days (e.g. specific sessions '
 'each day or weekends only) during which dogs are admitted. However, it must '
 'be noted that even during non-dog-admission sessions/days, permitted '
 'restaurants are still required to display designated signage at a '
 'conspicuous place at the entrance at all times.",\n'
