 '                "orig": "Guidelines on Good Practices and Behaviour for '
 'Dog-Friendly Restaurants Mutual Respect, Harmony with Pets",\n'
 '                "text": "Guidelines on Good Practices and Behaviour for '
 'Dog-Friendly Restaurants Mutual Respect, Harmony with Pets",\n'
 '                "formatting": null,\n'
