 '                },\n'
 '                "text": "In response to public demand as well as to promote '
 'human-pet harmony and create new business opportunities for the catering '
 'industry, the Government will introduce a new initiative in mid-2026 under '
 'which restaurant operators may apply for permission to allow the entry of '
 'dogs to their food premises. Food premises permitted to admit dogs '
 '(permitted restaurants) must display, at all times and at a conspicuous '
 'place at the entrance, signage in the designated format (see Annex 1) so '
 'that members of the public may choose whether to patronise them.",\n'
