 '                },\n'
 '                "text": "With the aim of ensuring food safety and public '
 'environmental hygiene, and protecting the safety of human and animals, the '
 'Government regulates customers bringing dogs and permitted restaurants '
 'through legislation and licensing conditions. Moreover, the Food and '
 'Environmental Hygiene Department (FEHD) has compiled this set of Guidelines '
 'on Good Practices and Behaviour (the Guidelines) for reference of restaurant '
 'operators and customers, with a view to striking an optimal balance between '
 'effective regulation and operational flexibility.",\n'
