 '                "text": "The Guidelines are divided into three parts: The '
 'first part is for reference of restaurant operators in devising operational '
 'arrangements and house rules; the second part sets out the best practices '
 'for customers bringing dogs to control their dogs in permitted restaurants; '
 'and the third part offers recommendations for other diners interacting with '
 'the dogs so as to promote mutual respect and understanding.",\n'
