 '                                    "text": "First, promptly determine which '
 'of the following categories the incident falls into: normal barking, '
 'persistent nuisance, lunging at people/chasing, biting people, '
 "defecation/soiling, or dog owners' refusal to cooperate. If a dog shows "
 'signs of rushing forward, baring teeth, lunging at people, chasing, fighting '
 'or biting, it should be regarded as a high-risk situation and should not be '
 'handled by way of mere general advice.",\n'
