 '                                "end_col_offset_idx": 2,\n'
 '                                "text": "First, promptly determine which of '
 'the following categories the incident falls into: normal barking, persistent '
 'nuisance, lunging at people/chasing, biting people, defecation/soiling, or '
 "dog owners' refusal to cooperate. If a dog shows signs of rushing forward, "
 'baring teeth, lunging at people, chasing, fighting or biting, it should be '
 'regarded as a high-risk situation and should not be handled by way of mere '
 'general advice.",\n'
 '                                "column_header": false,\n'
 '                                "row_header": false,\n'
 '                                "row_section": false,\n'
 '                                "fillable": false\n'
 '                            },\n'
 '                            {\n'
 '                                "bbox": {\n'
 '                                    "l": 14.062360554933548,\n'
 '                                    "t": 439.0104257464409,\n'
 '                                    "r": 64.70971529185772,\n'
