 '                            "text": "Record and report Record and report to '
 'the shop manager or the licensee the time of the incident, the table '
 'number/location, distinguishing features of the dog involved, details of the '
 'individuals involved, measures taken by staff, whether anyone was injured, '
 'and whether CCTV footage is available. If the incident involves a bite '
 '(Under the Rabies Ordinance (Cap. 421), its keeper must immediately report '
