 '                        "end_row_offset_idx": 4,\n'
 '                        "start_col_offset_idx": 1,\n'
 '                        "end_col_offset_idx": 2,\n'
 '                        "text": "Separate the crowd and ensure the safety of '
 'the scene If the situation is escalating, arrange for the affected customers '
 'to leave the scene first, prevent other customers from gathering around, '
 'provoking, or touching the dog, and suspend seating new customers near the '
 'incident location. Any food, utensils or hot drinks near the incident '
 'location should be removed as soon as possible to reduce risks to people and '
 'food safety.",\n'
 '                        "column_header": false,\n'
 '                        "row_header": false,\n'
 '                        "row_section": false,\n'
 '                        "fillable": false\n'
