 '                        "text": "Issue verbal instructions immediately The '
 'restaurant owner or staff should immediately require, in a clear and concise '
 'manner, the dog owner to control the dog by, for examples, shortening the '
 'dog leashes, bringing the dog back to his seat, stopping the dog from '
 'approaching other customers or removing the dog from the indoor area '
 'immediately. If the relevant requirements are already stated in the house '
 'rules, enforce them directly, and avoid getting into arguments with the dog '
 'owners over legal details.",\n'
