 '                        "text": "This requirement is to ensure that the dog '
 'remains under proper control while on the premises. Therefore, before '
 'allowing a customer with a dog to enter, restaurant staff should check '
 'whether the customer is an adult and whether the length of the leash '
 'complies with the legal requirement, among other things. If in doubt, staff '
 'should communicate clearly with the customer before entry to avoid any '
 'contravention.",\n'
