 '                        "text": "A7: Restaurants granted permission by the '
 'FEHD shall display at all times an A3 size signage designated by the '
 'department in a conspicuous place near the main entrances of the premises '
 'and must be clearly visible to customers before they enter the restaurant. '
 'Displaying the designated signage at the cashier counter, or allowing it to '
 'be obstructed or covered by other objects, will be regarded as a breach of '
 'the licensing conditions. Furthermore, restaurant operators must comply with '
 'any instructions given by FEHD officers regarding the manner of displaying '
 'the designated signage.",\n'
