 '                "orig": "A21: According to the licensing conditions, no dog '
 'shall be allowed on any dining table. This licensing condition is based on '
 'safety considerations and aims to protect the safety of restaurant staff, '
 'customers, and dogs, preventing accidents in which a dog, suddenly startled '
 'or excited, could knock over tabletop appliances, hot soup, or hot oil.",\n'
 '                "text": "A21: According to the licensing conditions, no dog '
