 '                "orig": "A22: To protect public health and ensure that '
 'humans and dogs do not share tableware, the licensing conditions stipulated '
 'that reusable utensils shall not be provided to dogs on the premises that '
 'are intended for human use. Restaurants may provide or sell single-use '
 'nonplastic utensils or crockery for dogs to use. Dog owners may also bring '
 'their own tableware for their dogs to use.",\n'
 '                "text": "A22: To protect public health and ensure that '
 'humans and dogs do not share tableware, the licensing conditions stipulated '
 'that reusable utensils shall not be provided to dogs on the premises that '
 'are intended for human use. Restaurants may provide or sell single-use '
 'nonplastic utensils or crockery for dogs to use. Dog owners may also bring '
 'their own tableware for their dogs to use.",\n'
