 '                "orig": "Q23: If a dog defecates or urinates inside a '
 'restaurant, who is responsible for cleaning it up? Can the restaurant charge '
 'a cleaning fee for this?",\n'
 '                "text": "Q23: If a dog defecates or urinates inside a '
 'restaurant, who is responsible for cleaning it up? Can the restaurant charge '
 'a cleaning fee for this?",\n'
 '                "formatting": null,\n'
 '                "hyperlink": null,\n'
 '                "level": 1\n'
