 '                ],\n'
 '                "orig": "1.8 Restaurant operators may, based on factors such '
 'as the actual usable space of their premises and operational experience, '
 'consider restricting the entry of certain dogs (e.g. whose owners fail to '
 'produce a dog licence and those that are particularly large, are unhygienic, '
 'agitated or visibly aggressive etc.). If there are such restrictions, they '
 'should be clearly stated in the \\"Notes to Customers\\" to minimise on-site '
 'disputes.",\n'
 '                "text": "Restaurant operators may, based on factors such as '
