 '                "text": "1.1 The Food Business Regulation (Cap. 132X) has '
 'been amended to allow dogs to enter food premises permitted to admit dogs '
 '(i.e. permitted restaurants) under specified circumstances. Any person '
 'engaged in a food business 1 and persons bringing dogs must comply with the '
 'statutory requirements (see Annex 2). Restaurant licensees must also comply '
 'with the licensing conditions (see Annex 3). The first part of the '
 'Guidelines is for reference of restaurant operators in devising their house '
